Linear FP16 backdrop blur for the existing wlroots Vulkan renderer.
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
Local implementation for notdevblue, 2026-11-07.

Scene-prefix suspend/resume design reference (no shader or pipeline code copied):
https://github.com/Seafoam-Labs/Aqueous/blob/e32ab7fc8f6510b393780b811ef92fe1bac6438e/docs/architecture-decisions/0001-vulkan-render-seam.md
Uses Vulkan filtered blits, preserving linear floating-point HDR values.
Two half-resolution downsample stages and matching upsample stages produce a
fixed pure low-pass blur. No contrast, vibrancy or normalized intermediate.
Visible blur uses full-frame prefix reconstruction rather than damage caches.
Two scratch images (full and half resolution) are owned by each output target.

